{"4795720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Voldark", "steam_appid": 4795720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795720/extras/3e220fb56bbd4969b1871417804ab295.poster.avif?t=1786638612\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795720/extras/3e220fb56bbd4969b1871417804ab295.webm?t=1786638612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795720/extras/3e220fb56bbd4969b1871417804ab295.mp4?t=1786638612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in a hostile wilderness, you must gather resources, craft tools and weapons, and develop your character to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and defend your base against relentless nighttime attacks, where waves of mutant creatures grow stronger with each passing night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit tribe members who will fight alongside you, helping to defend your base during deadly incursions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast forest filled with secrets, abandoned locations, and valuable loot as you prepare for the growing threat of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Open-world survival and crafting gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Base building and defense against nighttime attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character progression and upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Recruit tribe members to assist in base defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A dangerous forest filled with mutant creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exploration, scavenging, and resource gathering</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795720/extras/3e220fb56bbd4969b1871417804ab295.poster.avif?t=1786638612\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795720/extras/3e220fb56bbd4969b1871417804ab295.webm?t=1786638612\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4795720/extras/3e220fb56bbd4969b1871417804ab295.mp4?t=1786638612\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded in a hostile wilderness, you must gather resources, craft tools and weapons, and develop your character to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and defend your base against relentless nighttime attacks, where waves of mutant creatures grow stronger with each passing night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit tribe members who will fight alongside you, helping to defend your base during deadly incursions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast forest filled with secrets, abandoned locations, and valuable loot as you prepare for the growing threat of the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Open-world survival and crafting gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Base building and defense against nighttime attacks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Character progression and upgrades</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Recruit tribe members to assist in base defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• A dangerous forest filled with mutant creatures</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Exploration, scavenging, and resource gathering</p>", "short_description": "Voldark is an open-world survival crafting game set in a dangerous forest filled with mutant creatures. Gather resources, craft tools and weapons, level up your character, build and defend your base while su